{"publicId":"fadd9a08-82db-4fb6-8014-be911d6d7bc6","title":"普渡大学开发月球气凝胶隔热材料，热导率降至0.017 W/m·K","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T15:40:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T15:40:01.000Z","digest":"普渡大学团队通过矿物辅助研磨将纤维素分解为纳米纤维（<1微米），并与月壤复合制成气凝胶，热导率降低至0.017 W/m·K。该方法利用纤维素废料和月球原位资源，研究发表于《ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering》【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T15:48:11.571Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"普渡大学团队在ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering发表月球气凝胶隔热材料研究","latestReport":{"id":"t7aege87bfnwkr2gizbe5czsy"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fenvrZ654ZVU","title":"开发用于月球栖息地隔热的纳米纤维素-月壤复合气凝胶","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T15:40:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"t7aege87bfnwkr2gizbe5czsy","title":"普渡大学团队在ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering发表月球气凝胶隔热材料研究","summary":"普渡大学团队开发出利用月壤和纤维素废料制造气凝胶的方法，为月球栖息地提供隔热解决方案。研究显示矿物辅助研磨可将纤维素分解为纳米纤维（<1微米），提升气凝胶机械强度与隔热性能（热导率降低至0.017 W/m·K）。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T15:40:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"t7aege87bfnwkr2gizbe5czsy","title":"普渡大学团队在ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering发表月球气凝胶隔热材料研究","summary":"普渡大学团队开发出利用月壤和纤维素废料制造气凝胶的方法，为月球栖息地提供隔热解决方案。研究显示矿物辅助研磨可将纤维素分解为纳米纤维（<1微米），提升气凝胶机械强度与隔热性能（热导率降低至0.017 W/m·K）。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T15:40:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T02:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12